"""The JSON structural index and the `json_extract` kernel: the SIMD Stage 1 primitives (`simd_primitives`), the structural-token indexer (`structural_index`), the input size and column-count limits (`input_limits`), the JSON string unescaper (`parse_string`), the UTF-8 well-formedness check run before a `String` is built from input bytes (`utf8_check`), and the `json_extract` walker over a string column (`json_extract_kernel`)."""
